# Customer ICC — check inventory first

Before adding, changing, or proposing any send/receive on `IC_CH_CUSTOMER`:

1. Read `.cursor/Logs/Log19-Customer-ICC-traffic-inventory.md` (tag registry, payloads, rates, storage rules)
2. Read **both** `CM4/Customer/Inc/cust_icc.h` and `CM7/Customer/Inc/cust_icc.h` (must match)
3. Confirm receiver has a **per-tag** latest-value slot (CM4 must not overwrite steer with motor)
4. Update Log19 + Log15 when the wire format or rate changes

Cyclic commands → NO_ID + tag. One-shot ack events → WITH_ID (Log7).  
Never put blocking CM7 `dac_ctrl` in the control tick (Log18).
